@startuml
[*] --> Ready to Tag
Ready to Tag --> Processing New Item : New item added
Processing New Item --> Automatic Tagging : Attempt automatic tagging
Automatic Tagging --> Tagging Successful : Tagging successful
Tagging Successful --> [*]
Automatic Tagging --> Tagging Failed : Tagging failed
Tagging Failed --> Manual Tagging : Manual tagging initiated
Manual Tagging --> Tagging Successful : Tagging successful
@enduml
